OL,3,GNEWSAThe eye-catching sculptures found
OL,4,Aacross the West
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe south west is well known for its
OL,7,Fartistic culture - Bristol is the home
OL,8,Fof street art and Glastonbury hosts one
OL,9,Fof the biggest music festivals.
OL,11,FThis might be one of the reasons why
OL,12,Fyou can find so many interesting
OL,13,Fsculptures in the area: from the huge
OL,14,FWillow Man, now sadly falling into
OL,15,Fdisrepair, on the M5, to the Malmesbury
OL,16,Fmonk and more recent creations in
OL,17,FBristol.
OL,19,FHere is our list of where to find these
OL,20,Fvaried and fascinating sculptures.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
